    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/f/f6/Sutreia_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230119125239\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Sutreia Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/f/f6/Sutreia_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20230119125239\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"723\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Sutreia Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Sutreia_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><b>直率少女</b>\n</p><p>想说什么就说什么。她说话、行动和战斗都不加思考，全凭本能。由于对自己诚实，她从不压抑挫折感。\n\n</p><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/9/9e/Sutreia.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20241111025911\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Sutreia\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/9/9e/Sutreia.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20241111025911\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"740\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Sutreia.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Sutreia.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260820224435\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.007 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.009 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 1/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9